Package: ACL
Title: A Survey-Based Statistical Catch-at-Length Model
Version: 1.5.2
Authors@R: c(person("Hongyu", "Lin", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "linbojun99@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6226-179X")),
             person("Fan", "Zhang", role = "aut", email = "f-zhang@shou.edu.cn",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0214-1790")),
             person("Sisong", "Dong", role = "ctb"))
Maintainer: Hongyu Lin <linbojun99@gmail.com>
Description: Implements an age-length structured (ACL) operating model for
    survey-based statistical catch-at-length stock assessment. Designed for
    hard-to-age fisheries stocks, the package provides tools for model fitting,
    simulation testing, retrospective analysis, and diagnostic visualization.
